{'symbol': 'QCOM', 'date': '2021-11-03 16:00:00', 'title': "QUALCOMM EARNINGS RELEASE AVAILABLE ON COMPANY'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE", 'text': "SAN DIEGO, NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0QUALCOMM INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: QCOM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL 2021 THROUGH AN EARNINGS RELEASE THAT IS AVAILABLE ON THE QUALCOMM INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT HTTP://INVESTOR.QUALCOMM.COM/RESULTS.CFM. THE EARNINGS RELEASE WILL BE FURNISHED TO THE SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (SEC) ON A FORM 8-K AND WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE SEC WEBSITE AT HTTP://WWW.SEC.GOV."}